sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Researcher
    participant GO as Go Edge API
    participant PY as Python ExperimentService
    participant REG as StrategyRegistry
    participant DS as DatasetSnapshotService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant OUT as Transactional Outbox

    U->>GO: POST /experiments {strategy, market, execution}
    GO->>GO: auth/RBAC + quota + bounded schema validation
    GO->>PY: command + principal + idempotency/correlation ID
    PY->>REG: resolve exact root/child strategy versions
    REG-->>PY: immutable StrategySpec + fingerprints
    PY->>DS: ensure snapshot(provider,symbol,timeframe,range)
    DS->>DB: freeze Candle IDs + BBO event range<br/>compute candle_hash + bbo_hash + content_hash
    DS-->>PY: dataset_id, coverage, hashes, revision

    PY->>PY: validate execution policy<br/>LONG/SHORT, notional, fee, SL/TP,<br/>BBO fill and documented 5bps fallback
    PY->>PY: candidate_hash = canonical definition hash
    PY->>DB: find reusable completed run by<br/>strategy+dataset+execution+evaluator hashes

    alt reusable and force=false
        DB-->>PY: existing immutable result
        PY-->>GO: 200 reused=true + run_id
        GO-->>U: 200 reused=true + run_id
    else create new
        PY->>DB: BEGIN SERIALIZABLE
        PY->>DB: atomic quota admission
        PY->>DB: INSERT experiment snapshot<br/>strategy/dataset/execution/model refs
        PY->>DB: INSERT backtest_run queued
        PY->>DB: INSERT backtest_job queued
        PY->>OUT: INSERT ExperimentCreated + BacktestQueued pending<br/>with aggregate sequence
        PY->>DB: COMMIT
        PY-->>GO: 202 run_id + status=queued
        GO-->>U: 202 run_id + status=queued
    end

    Note over DS,DB: Worker chỉ đọc MARKET_DATASET_CANDLES/BBO đã freeze.<br/>Không reload operational candles rồi gọi đó là cùng dataset.
